ty starts a long cooldown that  is reduced by divas basic attacks call  mech is immediately available after  divas mech self-destructs divas first  heroic ability is bunnyhop  when activated divas mech becomes  unstoppable while dealing damage and  slowing all nearby enemies bunnyhop can  only be used in mech mode big shot  offers diva a powerful attack wall in  pilot mode she shoots a laser in a  straight line dealing damage to all  enemies in its path this ability has a  very short cooldown and it significantly  reduces call mechs cooldown for each  enemy hero it hits  Divac has two separate and distinct play  styles that depend on whether she's in  her mech Wallen mech mode diva has high  health and mobility allowing her to dive  in and bully the enemy team in pilot  mode diva deals high damage but has low  health attacking enemies will get her  back into her mech sooner but also puts  her at risk of dying diva automatically  enters pilot mode when her mech is  destroyed allowing her a chance to  escape keep in mind that this is divas  only form of survivability because she  can't use mounts in mech mode diva  relies on boosters to grant her the  mobility she needs to quickly get into  position boosters is a versatile ability  which can be used to traverse the  battlefield engage or escape from  enemies and chase down fleeing enemies  to finish them off Brewster's has a  short cooldown so don't hesitate to use  it when needed  self destruct forces enemies to either  evacuate a large area or suffer terrible  terrible damage launch her back forward  by using self-destruct while boosters is  active to turn it into a devastating  ranged attack diva can also cancel  boosters during self-destruct countdown  allowing her to place her mech precisely  where she wants it when playing against  diva use routes and stuns to prevent her  from escaping as you destroy her mech  and secure a kill destroying divas mech  only grants half the normal experience  so play aggressively 